#==============================================================================================
#
#   css_style_properties_3 - CSS::CSSStyleProperties: the resolved value of a property
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/CSSStyleProperties.cpp (lines 646-1043):
#       style_value_for_computed_property, the "resolved value" getComputedStyle() reports for a
#       property of an element with a layout node: used values of sizes, margins, paddings and
#       insets, colors, shadows, the transform matrix, the grid track lists, and shorthands
#       assembled from their longhands. Its lambdas are the private functions above it.
